162:Although [some tests have found that all versions of the MMC1 seems to reliably power on in the last bank](https://forums.nesdev.org/viewtopic.php?t=6766) (by setting the "PRG-ROM bank mode" to 3); [other tests have found that this is fragile](https://forums.nesdev.org/viewtopic.php?f=2&t=14958). Several commercial games have reset vectors every 32 KiB, but not every 16, so evidently PRG-ROM bank mode 2 doesn't seem to occur randomly on power-up.
